<title>JAPAN: Nippon Sanso to hold briefing on special losses.</title>
<headline>Nippon Sanso to hold briefing on special losses.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Sanso Corp said on Friday that it will hold a news conference at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT) on Friday at the Tokyo Stock Exchange to announce special losses incurred from the restructuring of its overseas operations.</p>
</text>
